SUMMARY:Baby/Toddler Open Swim
DESCRIPTION:Come make a splash at FSS at our Friday Baby/Toddler Open Swim located at our Beaverton location. Right now\, swimmers can sign up for 45 minute time slots between 10:00-12:15pm and it is only $4/person. Our indoor pool is heated to 90 degrees and is salt water! This is a family oriented open swim\, so adults must accompany their swimmers into the pool. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
