SUMMARY:Eat & Greet Community Celebration
DESCRIPTION:This community celebration brings together housed and unhoused neighbors for a night of food\, music\, games\, activities\, and building community. The event is completely free and open to all ages. \nEnjoy delicious offerings from Cece’s Gyros\, Chick-Fil-A\, Churros Locos\, Ice Cream Express and Tamale Boy\, along with live music by Gut String and Herencia Elegante. Guests can enjoy a variety of activities\, including a petting zoo\, photo booth\, and games for all ages. \nThe celebration is made possible through generous support from Metro’s Placemaking Grant\, with additional funding provided by Kaiser Permanente. Special thanks to Green Bridge Coffee and Synergy Environmental. \nLocation: Outside the Menlo Park Safe Rest Village – 12202 E Burnside Street
